/*
 * Implements semantic validation for slice indexing and slicing in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Validate integer indexing on slices.
 *   - Validate range indexing on slices(sub-slicing).
 *   - Perform compile-time bounds checking when possible.
 *   - Insert runtime bounds checks when necessary.
 *   - Construct SliceAccessValue or SliceCtorValue depending on the
 *     indexing mode.
 *   - Enforce unsafe-context restrictions for pointer-based access.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::index::slice
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/index/slice.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-06
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
